{"name":"The Arg Bell","slug":"glyph-arg-bell","blurb":"On the bind street, Gio carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Arg. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Arg Bell.","seal":"dabe98f1635689aedc12594e94726d93b6620bf64c836628d0f6515bf2b60ebb"}
